cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the following."
title: "sphalerite-kinetic-arrest: kinetic arrest and the survival of indium nanoinclusions in sphalerite"
abstract: >-
  Phase-field and lattice Monte Carlo study of why indium nanoinclusions survive
  in sphalerite when equilibrium thermodynamics demands a single condensed
  domain. Includes the closed-form interfacial energy, the bulk free energy by
  thermodynamic integration, a semi-implicit spectral Cahn-Hilliard solver with
  Arrhenius mobility and cooling, and direct lattice coarsening giving absolute
  domain sizes in nanometres.
